{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003664","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003664"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003664","label":"太中大夫明（三王世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"太中大夫明","mention_ids":["c-shiji-060-sanwang:m020-0245"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m020-0245","chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p020","quote":"太中大夫明"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m020-0245","start":245,"end":250,"surface":"太中大夫明","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003664","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji060-025","person_id":"cbr-p003664","title":"太中大夫","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang","source_id":"s-shiji-060-sanwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p020","quote":"王夫人者，趙人也，與衛夫人并幸武帝，而生子閎。閎且立為王時，其母病，武帝自臨問之。曰：「子當為王，欲安所置之？」王夫人曰：「陛下在，妾又何等可言者。」帝曰：「雖然，意所欲，欲於何所王之？」王夫人曰：「願置之雒陽。」武帝曰：「雒陽有武庫敖倉，天下衝阸，漢國之大都也。先帝以來，無子王於雒陽者。去雒陽，餘盡可。」王夫人不應。武帝曰：「關東之國無大於齊者。齊東負海而城郭大，古時獨臨菑中十萬戶，天下膏腴地莫盛於齊者矣。」王夫人以手擊頭，謝曰：「幸甚。」王夫人死而帝痛之，使使者拜之曰：「皇帝謹使使太中大夫明奉璧一，賜夫人為齊王太后。」子閎王齊，年少，無有子，立，不幸早死，國絕，為郡。天下稱齊不宜王云。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji060-025:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p020","start":245,"end":249,"surface":"太中大夫","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m020-0245","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依來源用稱保存，首次提及不補授職日；守、行事及兼攝不冒稱正式新授，單名及制度未定者不補姓或官制細節。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji060-032","person_id":"cbr-p003664","surfaces":["太中大夫明"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shij